WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.541 --> 00:00:31.916
In verse 17.14 of Chapter 17,

2
00:00:31.916 --> 00:00:32.500
Lord Krishna,

3
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.958
after describing the three

4
00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:37.208
guna-influenced forms of yajna, now

5
00:00:37.208 --> 00:00:40.916
draws attention to another important
spiritual aspect –

6
00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:42.916
tapasya, that is, austerity

7
00:00:42.916 --> 00:00:45.125
or discipline.

8
00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:48.333
Austerity is a means of self-purification

9
00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:49.375
and a major

10
00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:52.708
step toward spiritual progress.

11
00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:53.458
But

12
00:00:53.458 --> 00:00:54.958
it too can be influenced

13
00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:56.708
by different gunas –

14
00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:59.916
it depends on the seeker's desire,

15
00:00:59.916 --> 00:01:03.500
clarity, and inner state.

16
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.666
In the coming verses, Lord Krishna

17
00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:09.083
explains austerity by dividing it
into three parts –

18
00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:10.250
the austerity performed

19
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.666
by the body,

20
00:01:11.666 --> 00:01:15.250
the austerity of speech, and the
austerity of the mind.

21
00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:16.458
In this verse

22
00:01:16.458 --> 00:01:17.583
He discusses, in particular,

23
00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:20.000
the austerity of the body.

24
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.958
This austerity comes into sattva-guna

25
00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:27.083
when the body is used in
righteous conduct, restraint,

26
00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:29.083
and service.

27
00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:34.791
Such austerity leads the seeker toward
truth, health, and spiritual firmness.

28
00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:42.541
At the beginning of bodily austerity comes

29
00:01:42.541 --> 00:01:46.250
pujanam – offering respect.

30
00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:49.250
This does not mean only performing rituals,

31
00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:52.458
but honouring those individuals who are

32
00:01:52.458 --> 00:01:55.750
higher from a spiritual or moral standpoint.

33
00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:59.166
Among these are deva – God and the deities,

34
00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:01.333
dvija – those born into spiritual

35
00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:05.375
culture, guru – the spiritual

36
00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:09.125
teacher, and prajna – the truly wise,

37
00:02:09.125 --> 00:02:12.250
or family elders such as parents

38
00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:13.708
are included.

39
00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:17.000
Honouring such people brings humility

40
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.500
and makes us worthy of receiving knowledge.

41
00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:24.666
After this comes shaucham – cleanliness.

42
00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:28.916
This is not only outer but also inner –

43
00:02:28.916 --> 00:02:32.333
the purity of thoughts and intentions.

44
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:35.166
Outer cleanliness keeps the mind clear,

45
00:02:35.166 --> 00:02:37.500
and inner cleanliness comes from self-

46
00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.708
examination and sincerity.

47
00:02:40.708 --> 00:02:44.166
Then comes arjavam – simplicity

48
00:02:44.166 --> 00:02:47.375
and straightforwardness in life and conduct.

49
00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:51.125
It means – that what we think, say,

50
00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:54.541
and do should be in harmony.

51
00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:57.833
This frees us from complexities

52
00:02:57.833 --> 00:03:01.875
and lifts consciousness toward greater heights.

53
00:03:01.875 --> 00:03:05.875
Brahmacharyam means restraint.

54
00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:06.958
For the householder

55
00:03:06.958 --> 00:03:08.583
it is mutual trust

56
00:03:08.583 --> 00:03:12.083
and discipline toward one another,
and for the one

57
00:03:12.083 --> 00:03:15.375
on the path of renunciation, it is
restraint and celibacy.

58
00:03:15.375 --> 00:03:18.666
It means not only control, but

59
00:03:18.666 --> 00:03:20.000
also channelling that energy

60
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:23.791
toward higher purposes.

61
00:03:23.791 --> 00:03:25.125
Finally comes

62
00:03:25.125 --> 00:03:30.166
ahimsa – that is, not causing harm to others.

63
00:03:30.166 --> 00:03:33.041
Even when we are provoked,

64
00:03:33.041 --> 00:03:34.958
to restrain ourselves

65
00:03:34.958 --> 00:03:36.875
and respond with discernment

66
00:03:36.875 --> 00:03:38.916
is real strength.

67
00:03:38.916 --> 00:03:43.291
All these together form bodily austerity –

68
00:03:43.291 --> 00:03:46.500
which is endowed with the sattvic quality.

69
00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:49.458
These things may look simple,

70
00:03:49.458 --> 00:03:53.625
but to carry them out requires
awareness, restraint,

71
00:03:53.625 --> 00:03:57.750
and firm resolve toward spiritual progress.

72
00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.750
In today's

73
00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:08.458
world, filled with image, display, and complexity,

74
00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:11.750
I call you to rediscover

75
00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.000
arjavam – the power

76
00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:17.291
of simplicity.

77
00:04:17.291 --> 00:04:21.500
This is not about living with fewer means,

78
00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:27.583
but about connecting life to a higher purpose.

79
00:04:27.583 --> 00:04:30.125
When your thoughts, words, and actions

80
00:04:30.125 --> 00:04:31.750
flow together without conflict

81
00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:35.583
and without show,

82
00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:39.750
only then is it true bodily austerity.

83
00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.083
You do not need

84
00:04:41.083 --> 00:04:44.333
to impress the world with cleverness,

85
00:04:44.333 --> 00:04:48.958
nor to hide behind roles.

86
00:04:48.958 --> 00:04:52.208
Just be true.

87
00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:55.833
Be sincere. Be simple.

88
00:04:55.833 --> 00:05:00.208
You will find that most of your worry

89
00:05:00.208 --> 00:05:03.833
comes not from outer circumstances, but

90
00:05:03.833 --> 00:05:08.291
from the burden of maintaining your image.

91
00:05:08.291 --> 00:05:12.750
A lie spoken to create an artificial image

92
00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:15.583
gives birth to many more lies.

93
00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:19.125
Managing these gives a great deal of stress.

94
00:05:19.125 --> 00:05:23.000
Simplicity removes that burden.

95
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.750
It makes space for peace.

96
00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:29.958
Your life should not be about
maintaining an image,

97
00:05:29.958 --> 00:05:35.291
but about living your values.

98
00:05:35.291 --> 00:05:39.041
You will see that this bodily discipline

99
00:05:39.041 --> 00:05:44.208
shapes your emotional freedom.

100
00:05:44.208 --> 00:05:45.708
When you

101
00:05:45.708 --> 00:05:50.041
practise arjavam – simplicity –

102
00:05:50.041 --> 00:05:55.500
your body becomes an instrument of truth.

103
00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.708
And where there is truth,

104
00:05:58.708 --> 00:05:59.791
there I am.

105
00:06:04.708 --> 00:06:08.583
When you want to make your children modern,

106
00:06:08.583 --> 00:06:09.791
self-reliant,

107
00:06:09.791 --> 00:06:13.708
and confident,

108
00:06:13.708 --> 00:06:18.666
then be sure to teach them to show respect.

109
00:06:18.666 --> 00:06:20.708
I do not expect blind faith

110
00:06:20.708 --> 00:06:22.625
from you,

111
00:06:22.625 --> 00:06:25.208
but I urge you

112
00:06:25.208 --> 00:06:29.791
to keep alive the culture of showing respect.

113
00:06:29.791 --> 00:06:33.666
When you teach your children to bow

114
00:06:33.666 --> 00:06:35.416
before elders,

115
00:06:35.416 --> 00:06:39.166
to speak gently with household helpers,

116
00:06:39.166 --> 00:06:41.000
or to stand up with respect

117
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.875
when a teacher arrives –

118
00:06:43.875 --> 00:06:47.666
then you are teaching them not just etiquette,

119
00:06:47.666 --> 00:06:50.333
but bodily austerity.

120
00:06:50.333 --> 00:06:55.208
In a world where only boldness

121
00:06:55.208 --> 00:07:00.875
and aggression are glorified,

122
00:07:00.875 --> 00:07:03.500
this tradition may seem old-fashioned.

123
00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.250
But remember – real

124
00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:09.875
strength lies in humility itself.

125
00:07:09.875 --> 00:07:13.000
The mind becomes worthy of knowledge

126
00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:17.750
only when it learns to bow before wisdom.

127
00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.000
Show your children this –

128
00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:24.833
that you touch the feet of your parents,

129
00:07:24.833 --> 00:07:29.208
serve food with reverence, and do the service

130
00:07:29.208 --> 00:07:31.708
of the home not merely as a chore,

131
00:07:31.708 --> 00:07:35.000
but as a sacred duty.

132
00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:39.083
Following culture is not opposed to progress –

133
00:07:39.083 --> 00:07:40.833
rather, culture

134
00:07:40.833 --> 00:07:45.291
is the very pillar that gives
progress its foundation.

135
00:07:45.291 --> 00:07:47.791
And understand this too –

136
00:07:47.791 --> 00:07:51.500
where there is no culture of respect,

137
00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:54.791
there even the sharpest intellect

138
00:07:54.791 --> 00:07:56.708
becomes hollow.

139
00:07:56.708 --> 00:08:00.041
Make your children thinkers!

140
00:08:00.041 --> 00:08:03.333
Such thinkers who are full of faith

141
00:08:03.333 --> 00:08:08.291
and filled with the humble spirit
of showing respect.

142
00:08:13.166 --> 00:08:15.416
You may think

143
00:08:15.416 --> 00:08:19.541
that leadership happens only through the mind.

144
00:08:19.541 --> 00:08:22.041
But remember –

145
00:08:22.041 --> 00:08:25.208
other people assess your personality

146
00:08:25.208 --> 00:08:29.250
first through your body –

147
00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:34.208
your posture, your speech, your presentation.

148
00:08:34.208 --> 00:08:37.791
Your conduct too is an austerity –

149
00:08:37.791 --> 00:08:41.041
a bodily discipline.

150
00:08:41.041 --> 00:08:43.125
When you enter a room

151
00:08:43.125 --> 00:08:46.125
with a calm manner,

152
00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:49.500
speak respectfully to everyone regardless

153
00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.000
of their position,

154
00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.958
and maintain cleanliness

155
00:08:53.958 --> 00:08:56.875
and order in your workplace,

156
00:08:56.875 --> 00:08:58.125
then you

157
00:08:58.125 --> 00:09:02.416
silently spread integrity.

158
00:09:02.416 --> 00:09:05.791
Leadership comes not only from strategy,

159
00:09:05.791 --> 00:09:08.833
but also from presence.

160
00:09:08.833 --> 00:09:11.541
In today's fast-paced

161
00:09:11.541 --> 00:09:13.458
offices,

162
00:09:13.458 --> 00:09:16.041
where stress shows itself in signs of haste

163
00:09:16.041 --> 00:09:20.291
and reactive speech,

164
00:09:20.291 --> 00:09:22.750
there your composed body

165
00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:26.875
becomes the first identity of your leadership.

166
00:09:26.875 --> 00:09:31.000
Arjava – simplicity – is also essential.

167
00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.875
When your words and actions become one,

168
00:09:34.875 --> 00:09:38.708
when you leave behind pretence
and remain genuine,

169
00:09:38.708 --> 00:09:42.125
then people trust you.

170
00:09:42.125 --> 00:09:45.875
Do not consider these outer disciplines trivial.

171
00:09:45.875 --> 00:09:49.916
It is these that train the inner soul.

172
00:09:49.916 --> 00:09:52.916
A calm body. A clean space.

173
00:09:52.916 --> 00:09:55.208
A straightforward word.

174
00:09:55.208 --> 00:09:57.625
These are not small things –

175
00:09:57.625 --> 00:10:02.416
these are the foundation of sattva
in the workplace,

176
00:10:02.416 --> 00:10:06.166
and also the silent strength of true leadership.
